# 🎯 Key Learning

The main Context Manager pattern:

```python
with open("filename.txt", "mode") as file:
    # Work with the file
```

## Context Manager Flow

```text
with block starts
      ↓
Resource opens
      ↓
Use resource
      ↓
Error? ────── Yes/No
      ↓
with block ends
      ↓
Resource automatically closes
```

